 "note": "APPEND-ONLY successor. ARM-2 round-27 CORRECTIONS (Codex): all six findings executed. CRITICAL (protected environments do not exist): GitHub auto-creates a referenced-but-missing environment WITHOUT protection, so activation in the wrong order could bypass owner approval. NEW scripts/verify_protected_environments.py (owner-run, pure+unit-tested) requires BOTH trainer-image-publish AND arm2-calibration to exist with >=1 required reviewer; the arm2-calibration-launch caller also fails closed via a GitHub-API preflight (gh api environments/<name>, checks protection_rules required_reviewers>=1); the LOCAL-BOUNDARY-RUNBOOK documents the MANDATORY order (create+verify environments -> terraform apply -> role vars -> canaries -> image -> digest -> calibration). HIGH-2 (launcher not SHA-bound): arm2-calibration-launch-exec now takes an exact 40-hex sha input, checks out that sha, proves it is an ancestor of origin/master and that HEAD equals it \u2014 all BEFORE credentials \u2014 mirroring arm2-trainer-image-publish. HIGH-3 (deps after credentials): FULLY PINNED deps (boto3==1.40.16, PyYAML==6.0.2 [was unpinned pyyaml], jsonschema==4.25.0) install BEFORE OIDC federation. NEXT-STEP-2 (same-env wrong-ref canary): NEW arm2-calibration-canary-wrongref{,-exec}.yml run in the SAME arm2-calibration environment with a wrong job_workflow_ref -> must AccessDeny (only the workflow identity differs from the trust). MEDIUM-4 (parity hash not verified): the wrapper now records ours_hyp_sha256 AND upstream_hyp_sha256 per row (two independently-computed hypothesis hashes); verify_calibration requires both 64-hex AND EQUAL \u2014 64 zeros or a single self-consistent hash no longer passes (defect-tested: disagreeing hashes fail 'did not actually agree'). MEDIUM-5 (stale plan/packet evidence): NEW committed infra/arm2-activation-plan.txt records the EXACT 4 adds (trainer-image-publisher role+policy, arm2-calibration role+policy) + 1 change (arm-launch NoRemoteDebugEver deny) + 0 destroys and the binary plan sha256 6688d735...; the packet DRAFT_STATUS stale '2 add / 1 change' corrected to '4 add / 1 change / 0 destroy' with the resource list and the environment prerequisite; a test asserts the plan evidence is current. LOW-6 (terraform fmt): arm2_calibration_role.tf reformatted (fmt -check clean). Also hardened the calibration role's lifecycle precondition to require github_repo AND github_repo_immutable. Suites: 154 calibration host tests; 139 with torch; CI-matching no-torch 2429 passed / 0 failed. HOLDS UNCHANGED: NO Arm-2 compute, sealed data, promotion or deployment; roles + environments not yet created. Per the verdict: create+verify both protected environments FIRST, then terraform apply -> role vars -> positive/negative canaries -> reviewed image build/scan -> digest pin -> the small unsealed calibration.",
